          "path": "_m/c/2/9/p/abbotsford-wk/mission-city-railway-station-5.jpg",
          "filename": "Mission City railway station (5993731063).jpg",
          "caption": "This was one of the few actual railway stations the Rocky Mountaineer goes through.  Mission is a city that's the outer limit of the West Coast Express which provides commuter trains to Vancouver, taking about 80 minutes to get there.\n\nOr for a slower journey, you can take the West Coast Express TrainBus!  Which is a bus.  That follows the train line.",
